The ToutPanel software (the "Software") — a web hosting control panel comprising its program in compiled form (Python
bytecode), its interfaces, data files, templates, translations, documentation and installation scripts — is the
exclusive property of ToutPanel (qu3ntin01) (the "Licensor"). The Software is protected by the French Intellectual
Property Code and by international copyright treaties. It is licensed, not sold.

By installing, copying or using the Software, you (the "Licensee") agree to be bound by this licence. If you do not
agree, do not install or use the Software.

